    "updated_at": "2022-03-28T16:43:12Z",
    "body": "In the `[custom.name]` sections in your starship config, you need to add `shell =` settings (e.g., `shell = [\"sh\", \"--norc\", \"--noprofile\"]`) to avoid `nushell` from being used to run them when using `nushell`.\r\n\r\nBut instead, I would recommend using this in your starship config and removing all the custom modules:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"$shell$custom$git_branch$git_status$directory$character\"\r\n\r\n[shell]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nbash_indicator = \"🚀\"\r\nfish_indicator = \"🐠\"\r\nnu_indicator = \"🦀\"\r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
